  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/05/IMG_6730.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(102 fotos) L&#39;Associaci&oacute; Amics del Motoret ha proclamat aquest divendres a la seua primera Llaurador d&#39;Honor, Paula Rold&aacute;n Velasco, que aspira a ser reina de la Fira d&#39;Onda 2016,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/05/IMG_6804.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 720px;\" /></p>\n<p>igual que Elisabet Navarro Ramos, que tamb&eacute; ha estat a l&#39;acte.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllauradorahonorassociamotoret/img_6722.jpg\" alt=\"img_6722\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllauradorahonorassociamotoret/img_6726.jpg\" alt=\"img_6726\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllauradorahonorassociamotoret/img_6728.jpg\" alt=\"img_6728\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllauradorahonorassociamotoret/img_6729.jpg\" alt=\"img_6729\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllauradorahonorassociamotoret/img_6730.jpg\" alt=\"img_6730\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllauradorahonorassociamotoret/img_6731.jpg\" alt=\"img_6731\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllauradorahonorassociamotoret/img_6732.jpg\" alt=\"img_6732\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllauradorahonorassociamotoret/img_6733.jpg\" al